 ## Background
-This method is associated with the `vtkGPUMultiVolumeRayCastMapper` in VTK and was described in the context of ray tracing structured AMR (Adaptive Mesh Refinement) data using ExaBricks [S2]. It was introduced to support high-quality cell interpolation and interactive visualization on individual GPU workstations for highly complex models [S2]. The implementation details are found in the VTK source code for `vtkOpenGLGPUMultiVolumeRayCastMapper` [S1].
